{"id": 14391, "title": "What to do tomorrow?", "japanese_title": "明日は何をする？", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "what-to-do-tomorrow", "audio_url": "/audio/japanese/14391_what-to-do-tomorrow.mp3", "english_paragraphs": ["A: What do you want to do tomorrow?", "B: Go to school tomorrow.", "A: Tomorrow is Saturday, off.", "B: Yes, I forgot. I want to sleep at home tomorrow morning, and I want to go to the bookstore to buy books in the afternoon. What about you?", "A: I want to go shopping.", "B: What do you want to buy?", "A: I want to buy a cup, a carton of milk, and some fruit.", "B: What fruit do you like to eat?", "A: I like to eat bananas and apples.", "B: There is no more fruit at my house. The apples are very good now. Please help me buy a pound.", "A: No problem. What time should I give you the apple tomorrow?", "B: I will go home from the bookstore at five o'clock tomorrow. You can come to my house at five o'clock. You can also have dinner at my house and we can cook it ourselves tomorrow, how about that?", "A: OK, I will go to your house at five o'clock tomorrow."], "english_full": "A: What do you want to do tomorrow?\n\nB: Go to school tomorrow.\n\nA: Tomorrow is Saturday, off.\n\nB: Yes, I forgot. I want to sleep at home tomorrow morning, and I want to go to the bookstore to buy books in the afternoon. What about you?\n\nA: I want to go shopping.\n\nB: What do you want to buy?\n\nA: I want to buy a cup, a carton of milk, and some fruit.\n\nB: What fruit do you like to eat?\n\nA: I like to eat bananas and apples.\n\nB: There is no more fruit at my house. The apples are very good now. Please help me buy a pound.\n\nA: No problem. What time should I give you the apple tomorrow?\n\nB: I will go home from the bookstore at five o'clock tomorrow. You can come to my house at five o'clock. You can also have dinner at my house and we can cook it ourselves tomorrow, how about that?\n\nA: OK, I will go to your house at five o'clock tomorrow.", "japanese_paragraphs": ["Ａ：明日は何をしたい？", "Ｂ：明日は学校に行くよ。", "Ａ：明日は土曜日だから、学校は休みだよ。", "Ｂ：そうだった、忘れてた。明日の朝は家で寝ていたいな。午後は本屋に本を買いに行きたい。そっちは？", "Ａ：買い物に行きたいな。", "Ｂ：何を買いたいの？", "Ａ：コップを一つ、牛乳を一パック、それから果物を少し買いたい。", "Ｂ：どんな果物が好き？", "Ａ：バナナとりんごが好き。", "Ｂ：うちにはもう果物がないんだ。今はりんごがおいしいから、一ポンド分買ってきてくれる？", "Ａ：もちろん。明日は何時にりんごを持っていけばいい？", "Ｂ：明日は五時に本屋から帰るよ。五時にうちに来てね。夕飯も一緒に食べよう。明日は二人で作ろうよ。どう？", "Ａ：いいよ。じゃあ、明日の五時にそっちの家に行くね。"], "reading_paragraphs": ["えー：あした は なに を したい？", "びー：あした は がっこう に いく よ。", "えー：あした は どようび だから、がっこう は やすみ だ よ。", "びー：そうだった、わすれてた。あした の あさ は いえ で ねていたい な。ごご は ほんや に ほん を かい に いきたい。そっち は？", "えー：かいもの に いきたい な。", "びー：なに を かいたい の？", "えー：こっぷ を ひとつ、ぎゅうにゅう を いちぱっく、それから くだもの を すこし かいたい。", "びー：どんな くだもの が すき？", "えー：ばなな と りんご が すき。", "びー：うち には もう くだもの が ない ん だ。いま は りんご が おいしい から、いちぽんどぶん かってきてくれる？", "えー：もちろん。あした は なんじ に りんご を もっていけば いい？", "びー：あした は ごじ に ほんや から かえる よ。ごじ に うち に きて ね。ゆうはん も いっしょ に たべよう。あした は ふたり で つくろう よ。どう？", "えー：いい よ。じゃあ、あした の ごじ に そっち の いえ に いく ね。"], "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"エー\" data-defn=\"A/a\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">Ａ</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"：\" data-defn=\"： (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">：</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あした\" data-defn=\"tomorrow\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">明日</span><rt>あした</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"なに\" data-defn=\"what; you-know-what/that thing\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">何</span><rt>なに</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"を\" data-defn=\"direct object marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">を</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"し\" data-defn=\"to do (stem of する)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">し</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たい\" data-defn=\"want to (verbal suffix of desire)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><sp